<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Dækker eksamenskriterier&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Netværk:&lt;/b&gt; VPC/CIDR, subnets, IGW, NAT, DNS 53, HTTPS 443, 8080, 5432, VPN&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Virtualisering/containere:&lt;/b&gt; ECS Fargate, ECR&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cloudmodel:&lt;/b&gt; PaaS (S3, Fargate, RDS), IaaS (VPC), SaaS (Identity Center)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sikkerhed:&lt;/b&gt; WAF, Security Groups, TLS, KMS, MFA, private subnets&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Drift:&lt;/b&gt; multi-AZ, autoskalering, backup, CloudWatch&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Økonomi:&lt;/b&gt; pay-as-you-go; NAT og RDS er dyre poster&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GDPR:&lt;/b&gt; EU-region, kryptering, adgangslog&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ikon-nøgle (farvet tekst under ikon)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#455a64'&gt;&lt;b&gt;FYSISK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = fysisk maskine (PC, server, laptop)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;VM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = virtuel maskine&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#e65100'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CONTAINER&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = Docker/Fargate-container&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;STORAGE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = lager/filer/backup&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#ad1457'&gt;&lt;b&gt;DATABASE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = database&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6a1b9a'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GATEWAY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = gateway/router/VPN/NAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#c62828'&gt;&lt;b&gt;FIREWALL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = firewall/Security Group/WAF&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#00695c'&gt;&lt;b&gt;MANAGED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = AWS-administreret tjeneste&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Zoner:&lt;/b&gt; rød-stiplet = EKSTERNT netværk (internet), grøn/blå = INTERNT netværk (privat)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Eksempel-IP: 203.0.113.x og 198.51.100.x er dokumentations-IP (RFC 5737). 10.x, 172.16-31.x og 192.168.x er private (RFC 1918).&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2200" y="260" width="290" height="990" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
